#* {{quote-journal|en-GB|author=w:Timothy Garton Ash|title=War or peace? Dictatorship or democracy? Europe’s future is on the line|work=The Guardian|date=2023-12-13|url=https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2023/dec/13/war-peace-dictatorship-democracy-europe-european-council-liberalism-populism|issn=0261-3077|passage=War or peace? Dictatorship or democracy? Europe’s future is '''on the line''' [title]}}
